## Managerial Interpretation

<div class="hero-text">
The real value is not only knowing whether customers are happy or unhappy.
</div>

<div class="main-text">
The real value is knowing which operational problem should be solved first.
</div>

## Strengths and Limitations

<div class="two-boxes">
<div class="box">
<b>Strengths</b><br><br>
